-- Seed the global (coach_id IS NULL) exercise library with curated exercise
-- data scraped from fitnessprogramer.com (exercise-primary-muscle listing
-- pages and individual exercise detail pages), covering all 15
-- fitnessprogramer primary-muscle categories mapped down to this table's
-- simpler muscle_group buckets. English content (steps_en/instructions_en)
-- is taken from the site; Arabic content (name_ar/steps_ar/instructions_ar)
-- is an original translation into natural fitness-register Modern Standard
-- Arabic, matching the tone of supabase/seed.sql. coach_id is left NULL so
-- every coach sees these as platform-curated library entries (see
-- read_own_and_global policy on public.exercises).
--
-- Source: https://fitnessprogramer.com/exercise-primary-muscle/<category>/
-- One-time educational/dev-seed scrape of publicly listed exercise names,
-- instructions, and muscle/equipment metadata -- not a repeated crawl.

